조; mso-font-width: 97%\">경쟁</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">중심에서 벗어나 학생 참여형 수업문화 확대하고 있는 자유학기를 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">지원하고자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2019 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">자유학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">대학생 봉사단</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">을 운영합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">중학생들이 소질과 적성을 키울 수 있도록 다양한 체험 활동을 중심으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">자유학기제 수업을 지원할</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">대학생 동아리를 모집하고자 하오니 창의적이고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">열정 있는 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%\">생 여러분의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -26.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">​</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><p></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
